@host = http://localhost:5250

### Fully composed CRUD
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-1",
  "quantity": 2,
  "expiresAt": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z"
}

###

GET {{host}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

GET {{host}}/orders/pages?pageSize=2

###

POST {{host}}/orders/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "sku": "SKU-A", "quantity": 1, "expiresAt": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z" },
  { "sku": "SKU-B", "quantity": 2, "expiresAt": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z" }
]

### Multi-document transaction (replica set)
POST {{host}}/transactions/place-order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-TX",
  "quantity": 1,
  "amount": 19.95
}

### Canonical Extended JSON payload
POST {{host}}/json/payloads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "_id": { "$oid": "573a1391f29313caabcd9637" },
  "count": { "$numberInt": "7" }
}

###

GET {{host}}/json/payloads/573a1391f29313caabcd9637

###

GET {{host}}/provisioning/dry-run

###

GET {{host}}/escape/collection

###

GET {{host}}/notes

